  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Anti-Corruption Strategy IDF Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IDF Grant will assist the Government of Armenia to develop and monitor the implementation of a credible and transparent medium-term Anti-Corruption Strategy.  The Strategy will be designed with the involvement of eminent figures from the three branches of the state and with intensive consultation with civil society and donor partners.  The Grant will also assist Government and Parliament to develop and utilize tools and indicators to assess the impact of the measures that will be proposed in the Anti-Coruption Strategy.  It will thus build expertise and capacity to effectively monitor, and publicly report at frequent intervals, the impact of the medium-term program to improve governance and reduce corruption.</narrative>
  </description>
